ands the senior USPS officials to whom subpoena approval authority may be delegated to include the Chief Postal Inspector.</p>","updateDate":"2025-04-23T20:08:00Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"USPS Subpoena Authority Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2025-05-16T08:06:06Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2025-05-16T08:06:06Z"}
